{"id":"entonces","lemma":"entonces","pos":"adv","rank":67,"glosses":["then, next, thereupon, at that time, at that point","then, therefore, so, thus; in that case"],"ipa":"/enˈtonθes/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/46/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-entonces.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Entonces qué hiciste?","en":"What did you do then?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/107039","words":[null,{"g":"what"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"}]},{"text":"Entonces, ¿cuál es el plan?","en":"What's the plan, then?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/97074","words":[null,{"g":"which one, what, which"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"plan"}]},{"text":"Entonces será demasiado tarde.","en":"It'll be too late then.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/44516","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"too much"},{"g":"late"}]},{"text":"¿Entonces ahora qué hago?","en":"So what do I do now?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/731895","words":[null,{"g":"now"},{"g":"what"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"}]},{"text":"Entonces mañana le pregunto.","en":"I will ask him about it tomorrow, then.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/788344","words":[null,{"g":"tomorrow"},{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to ask","l":"preguntar"}]}]}